      "descriptions": {
        "none": [
          "Korektor is a statistical spell-checker and (occasionally) grammar-checker.  It is released under 2-Clause BSD license http://opensource.org/licenses/BSD-2-Clause.\r\n\r\nKorektor started with Michal Richter's diploma thesis Advanced Czech Spellchecker https://redmine.ms.mff.cuni.cz/documents/1, but it is being developed further. There are two versions: a command line utility (tested on Linux, Windows and OS X) and a REST service with publicly available API http://lindat.mff.cuni.cz/services/korektor/api-reference.php and HTML front end https://lindat.mff.cuni.cz/services/korektor/."
        ]
      },
